You add a lot of rtl8723bs specific code here. I wonder if it wouldn't be better
to move all this to rtl8723b[s].c ?

> @@ -2877,6 +3076,33 @@ void rtw_coex_scan_notify(struct rtw_dev *rtwdev, u8 type)
